{"ready":true,"data":{"id":"sean-kleier","name":"Sean Kleier","birthDate":"1987-03-29","birthPlace":"Louisville, Kentucky, USA","bio":"Sean Thompson Kleier (born 1987) is an American actor. He is primarily known for the role of Lex Von Weber in Odd Mom Out, Mikel in Happyish[1] and appeared as Agent Stoltz in Marvel's Ant-Man and the Wasp.\n\nKleier grew up in Louisville, Kentucky, and was educated there at Kentucky Country Day School. He further studied at Bowdoin College before moving to New York and doing improv with the Upright Citizens Brigade.\n\nA co-founder of the production and media strategy company Motiv Creative, Kleier and his brother create content for political advocacy groups, particularly Represent.Us, a non-profit working on grassroots corruption, campaign finance and electoral reform.\n\nKleier played Agent Stoltz in the film Ant-Man and the Wasp (2018).\n\nFrom Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia","source":"TMDB","fetchedAt":"2026-11-19T17:46:46+00:00","tmdbId":1425463,"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/1425463","credits":[{"id":"antman-wasp","title":"Ant-Man and the Wasp","character":"Agent Stoltz"}],"photo":"./public-data/images/people/sean-kleier.webp","filmography":[{"name":"The Elephant in the Room","year":2025,"character":"Vincent","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/oEWCmXH266Sc2wNsdiVIPBFEJJ4.jpg"},{"name":"Wedding Season","year":2022,"character":"Nick","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/mFeXAZ1oOECPqEu8c2i4L5LmNyY.jpg"},{"name":"Chris Watts: Confessions of a Killer","year":2020,"character":"Chris Watts","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/r1l8RNzMdIXZHf4ddJw8lzMzIIg.jpg"},{"name":"Off Season","year":2019,"character":"Devon","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/8sbY6OhF4CF3sL1ht7paCswcdpc.jpg"},{"name":"Ant-Man and the Wasp","year":2018,"character":"Agent Stoltz","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/cFQ